  "body": "Tucked away in a peaceful and private setting, this beautifully presented home has been tastefully renovated to a standard of quality and finish seldom found in this price range.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning kitchen featuring a generous island bench, the perfect gathering place for family and friends. The spacious open plan living area enjoys a soaring ceiling that creates a wonderful sense of light and space, with a lovely connection to the expansive private deck, ideal for relaxing or entertaining friends and family around the BBQ.\r\nThree bedrooms are complemented by a stylish modern bathroom featuring quality fittings and finishes. A ducted central heating and cooling system ensures year round comfort, while double garaging and additional off street parking add to the convenience.\r\nThe fully fenced section is ideal for dog lovers, while the peaceful setting away from busy roads creates a wonderful haven for your feline friends too. A private little paradise for you and your pets to enjoy.\r\nBeautiful Waiake Beach is within walking distance, perfect for a morning swim or leisurely stroll along the sand, while Torbay School is also an easy walk for the kids.\r\nConstructed with painted plywood and Coloursteel cladding to the upper level and a Coloursteel roof, this beautifully maintained home is ready for you to move in and enjoy. The freehold title is another bonus with no body corporate fees to worry about.\r\nAfter 10 happy years, our owners are relocating and have offered their much loved home at a very realistic price.\r\nNo waiting for auctions or deadline sales here! Just come along, fall in love and make your offer.\r\nImagine celebrating Christmas in your beautiful new home, with family and friends gathered around that stunning kitchen island and the BBQ sizzling on the deck.\r\nWhy wait? Your new lifestyle could begin before Christmas!",
